::Normal Form::
Which normal form ensures that every non-key attribute is completely dependent only on the primary key? {
~ BCNF
= 2NF
~ 3NF
~ None of the above
}

::Normalization::
Which of the following is not an objective of normalization? {
~ eliminate redundant data
= reducing the amount of tables
~ to ensure data dependencies make sense
~ None of the above
}

::Normalization::
For a table to be in 3NF, the relationship between any two non-key attributes should not be a 1:1 relation. {FALSE}




